* '''Player:''' Hello. What do you do here?
* '''Gnosi:''' My name is Gnosi. I am here to assist the Varrock Museum in their research.
* '''Player:''' I didn't know the Varrock Museum was familiar with this continent. What research are you conducting?
* '''Gnosi:''' We're studying the history of the region, origins of the lizardmen and how it all connects to Xeric.
* '''Gnosi:''' We've wanted to study this place for a while, but haven't been able to explore due to lizardmen blocking the way.
* '''Gnosi:''' But now that the Shayzien Army have cleared the path and discovered the Chambers of Xeric in the process, there is much to explore!
